{"id":"200eacd293b1282b","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-adjoint.md","title":"Adjoint","display":"df-adjoint — Adjoint","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-adjoint","aliases":["58-df-adjoint","Adjoint","Hermitian Adjoint"],"display":"df-adjoint — Adjoint","depends_on":["[[58-df-bounded-operator]]","[[58-df-hilbert-space]]","[[58-df-inner-product]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-adjoint"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-adjoint</span><span>Adjoint</span><span>Hermitian Adjoint</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-adjoint — Adjoint"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"58-df-bounded-operator\">58-df-bounded-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"58-df-hilbert-space\">58-df-hilbert-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce5a656462edb0c9\" href=\"?note=ce5a656462edb0c9\" title=\"58-df-inner-product\">58-df-inner-product</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,T^\\ast,H,K,B_H,B_K,k,+_H,\\odot_H,+_K,\\odot_K\\in V\">\\(T,T^\\ast,H,K,B_H,B_K,k,+_H,\\odot_H,+_K,\\odot_K\\in V\\)</span> (operators and explicit Hilbert structures)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\)</span> (Hilbert-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"58-df-hilbert-space\">58-df-hilbert-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\)</span> (fully explicit bounded-operator predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"58-df-bounded-operator\">58-df-bounded-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdjointStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AdjointStructure}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S\\)</span> (explicit adjoint relation and compatibility projection)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{AdjointStructure}_S(T,T^\\ast,H,B_H,K,B_K,k,+_H,\\odot_H,+_K,\\odot_K)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(K,B_K,k,+_K,\\odot_K)\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T;H,\\nu_{B_H},+_H,\\odot_H;K,\\nu_{B_K},+_K,\\odot_K;k)\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T^\\ast;K,\\nu_{B_K},+_K,\\odot_K;H,\\nu_{B_H},+_H,\\odot_H;k)\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;\\forall y\\in K\\;B_K(T(x),y)=B_H(x,T^\\ast(y))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{AdjointStructure}_S(T,T^\\ast,H,B_H,K,B_K,k,+_H,\\odot_H,+_K,\\odot_K)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(K,B_K,k,+_K,\\odot_K)\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T;H,\\nu_{B_H},+_H,\\odot_H;K,\\nu_{B_K},+_K,\\odot_K;k)\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T^\\ast;K,\\nu_{B_K},+_K,\\odot_K;H,\\nu_{B_H},+_H,\\odot_H;k)\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;\\forall y\\in K\\;B_K(T(x),y)=B_H(x,T^\\ast(y))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(T,T^\\ast,H,K)\\leftrightarrow\\exists B_H,B_K,k,+_H,\\odot_H,+_K,\\odot_K\\in V\\;\\mathrm{AdjointStructure}_S(T,T^\\ast,H,B_H,K,B_K,k,+_H,\\odot_H,+_K,\\odot_K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(T,T^\\ast,H,K)\\leftrightarrow\\exists B_H,B_K,k,+_H,\\odot_H,+_K,\\odot_K\\in V\\;\\mathrm{AdjointStructure}_S(T,T^\\ast,H,B_H,K,B_K,k,+_H,\\odot_H,+_K,\\odot_K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The two Hilbert structures and their induced norms are shared consistently by boundedness and the adjoint equation.</li>\n<li>Adjoint: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^*\">\\(T^*\\)</span> s.t. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle Tx, y\\rangle = \\langle x, T^*y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle Tx, y\\rangle = \\langle x, T^*y\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li>Self-adjoint: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T = T^*\">\\(T = T^*\\)</span>, real spectrum</li>\n<li>Normal: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"TT^* = T^*T\">\\(TT^* = T^*T\\)</span></li>\n<li>Polar decomposition: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T = U|T|\">\\(T = U|T|\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> partial isometry</li>\n<li>Operator norm, self-adjointness and unitarity are downstream predicates, not part of this definition atom.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Reed and Simon, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-bounded-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bounded-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hilbert-space","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hilbert-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-inner-product","status":"resolved","id":"ce5a656462edb0c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-inner-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hilbert-space","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S$ (Hilbert-space predicate, see [[58-df-hilbert-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bounded-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S$ (fully explicit bounded-operator predicate, see [[58-df-bounded-operator]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,T^\\ast,H,K,B_H,B_K,k,+_H,\\odot_H,+_K,\\odot_K\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdjointStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{AdjointStructure}_S(T,T^\\ast,H,B_H,K,B_K,k,+_H,\\odot_H,+_K,\\odot_K)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(K,B_K,k,+_K,\\odot_K)\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T;H,\\nu_{B_H},+_H,\\odot_H;K,\\nu_{B_K},+_K,\\odot_K;k)\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T^\\ast;K,\\nu_{B_K},+_K,\\odot_K;H,\\nu_{B_H},+_H,\\odot_H;k)\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;\\forall y\\in K\\;B_K(T(x),y)=B_H(x,T^\\ast(y))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(T,T^\\ast,H,K)\\leftrightarrow\\exists B_H,B_K,k,+_H,\\odot_H,+_K,\\odot_K\\in V\\;\\mathrm{AdjointStructure}_S(T,T^\\ast,H,B_H,K,B_K,k,+_H,\\odot_H,+_K,\\odot_K)","display":true},{"tex":"T^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle Tx, y\\rangle = \\langle x, T^*y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"T = T^*","display":false},{"tex":"TT^* = T^*T","display":false},{"tex":"T = U|T|","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false}],"bytes":2004,"backlinks":[{"id":"7da7ff11e397ca55","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c6ace29e12d6a2ff","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2ec0511903e19292","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AdjointStructure}_S$ (adjoint-operator predicate, see [[58-df-adjoint]])"},{"id":"6da70a87682c611a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-adjoint.md]])."},{"id":"5998e080b5d378a0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(T,T^*,H,H)$ (bounded-operator adjoint relation, see [[58-df-adjoint]])"},{"id":"0e9a7e858e6fae46","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(V,V^\\ast,H,K)$（伴随关系，见 [[../batch12/58-df-adjoint.md]]）"},{"id":"80bac75f5ebf9855","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(N,N^\\ast,H,H)$ (adjoint relation, see [[58-df-adjoint]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-adjoint]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-adjoint.md|58-df-adjoint]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["2ad9c248fe18df37","b70ce791d5b1a19b","ce5a656462edb0c9"]}